ld/validate]} {:db/id "q-23597" :question/id #uuid "a45a07ce-ef6d-5305-907c-a2cbfdebbfff" :question/math-academy-id "q-23597" :question/problem "Simplify $(\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta -1)(\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta +1).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we expand the parentheses:\n\n$$\n(\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta -1)(\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta +1)={sec}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\n$$\n\nThen, we recall the different forms of the secant-tangent Identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & (1) & 1+{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta ={sec}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & (2) & {tan}^{2}⁡\\theta ={sec}^{2}⁡\\theta -1 \\\\  & (3) & {sec}^{2}⁡\\theta -{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can rewrite our expression using $(2),$ as follows:\n\n$$\n{sec}^{2}⁡\\theta -1={tan}^{2}⁡\\theta \n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n(\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta -1)(\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta +1)={tan}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-23597/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "eda44360-52ec-59f7-98b4-f8d866a465e9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-23597"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-65402/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "9243f118-5dbf-5669-a3fa-6fcbcb421146" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65402/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" :answer/id #uuid "27274b88-5b8d-5d10-833c-536c65e2ea3a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65402/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" :answer/id #uuid "8cc9083d-e297-576b-9e1e-0eb4eb479bbd" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{1}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65402/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" :answer/id #uuid "5045282d-d179-523e-9b3b-85988254690f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65402/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "793dd14a-2fd2-5512-b9a8-1034f4e55a20" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-65402/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "3fff5922-d168-5a6c-983f-c1ce7121dff4" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-65402/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer-field/choices ["q-65402/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-65402/selection/681a4b64a7bb464b7f554c4e26477e3547d3c60cd353fce5dda4ae108b1c4fa5" "q-65402/selection/4e2cb386499e1926f074a7bcd422a63175a237204a3823f0fa6c86b56d301873" "q-65402/selection/e9bc05c525076ace5dedc0dc52c4f8497f441cd3bf97b666736f75acd9994b26" "q-65402/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-65402" :question/id #uuid "84160774-04b0-5e68-a9e4-2c2792c403e3" :question/math-academy-id "q-65402" :question/problem "Simplify $(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+\\operatorname{tan}⁡x).$" :question/worked-solution "First, we expand the parentheses:\n\n$$\n(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)={sec}^{2}⁡x-{tan}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nThen, we recall the different forms of the secant-tangent Identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & (1) & 1+{tan}^{2}⁡x={sec}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & (2) & {tan}^{2}⁡x={sec}^{2}⁡x-1 \\\\  & (3) & {sec}^{2}⁡x-{tan}^{2}⁡x=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can rewrite our expression using $(3),$ as follows:\n\n$$\n{sec}^{2}⁡x-{tan}^{2}⁡x=1\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x-\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)(\\operatorname{sec}⁡x+\\operatorname{tan}⁡x)=1.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-65402/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "eda44360-52ec-59f7-98b4-f8d866a465e9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-65402"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-23796/selection/a0332b537f4486805ad1793740b0a1ac4165eaeb48e40facdc78c5de1981c15a" :answer/id #uuid "ca4b5d87-d89c-5b1e-85d9-ed37a537e25a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23796/selection/bbbbf8af302753ca905188e09e4a1284c668cbdd8c0ff86fe10d417707c71f1c" :answer/id #uuid "97b5a8e8-e030-5e3a-97cd-a0e7061be567" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta -1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23796/selection/97aafc362429928161d2a89624c6d976247cb081dab8dc3d752ac95ed04d1239" :answer/id #uuid "81ab952d-d927-5dcf-ad5f-2766a010eef1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23796/selection/fbdfea5b1daf4d74b7704516814c3c28369f5bc5063ac90d7a612b0fa0bb5de8" :answer/id #uuid "130b0653-8d24-5c9d-9612-1d2c45de5c97" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta " :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23796/selection/1ad009c7386646ccea2b504857d5aa5a3257dc0f94e6e25b04ec94802f2010cb" :answer/id #uuid "b24dde4d-da9c-562d-9c7e-5cc08bd679aa" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta +1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-23796/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "e8d778ec-9a4f-52fd-bb35-a664a5bd3d16" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-23796/selection/a0332b537f4486805ad1793740b0a1ac4165eaeb48e40facdc78c5de1981c15a" :answer-field/choices ["q-23796/selection/a0332b537f4486805ad1793740b0a1ac4165eaeb48e40facdc78c5de1981c15a" "q-23796/selection/bbbbf8af302753ca905188e09e4a1284c668cbdd8c0ff86fe10d417707c71f1c" "q-23796/selection/97aafc362429928161d2a89624c6d976247cb081dab8dc3d752ac95ed04d1239" "q-23796/selection/fbdfea5b1daf4d74b7704516814c3c28369f5bc5063ac90d7a612b0fa0bb5de8" "q-23796/selection/1ad009c7386646ccea2b504857d5aa5a3257dc0f94e6e25b04ec94802f2010cb"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-23796" :question/id #uuid "865215e5-5e9a-5d33-9549-0e100dbb1d6a" :question/math-academy-id "q-23796" :question/problem "${csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ({tan}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the following identities: \n\n$$\n\\operatorname{tan}⁡\\theta =\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\,\\operatorname{sec}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta }\\,\\operatorname{csc}⁡\\theta =\\frac{1}{\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta }\n$$\n\nNext, we expand the parentheses and use the above identities, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ({tan}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta ) & ={csc}^{2}⁡\\theta \\cdot {tan}^{2}⁡\\theta -{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta \\cdot {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }\\cdot \\frac{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }-\\frac{1}{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }\\cdot {sin}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }}\\cdot \\frac{\\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }}{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }-\\frac{1}{\\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta }}\\cdot \\cancel{{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta } \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{{cos}^{2}⁡\\theta }-1 \\\\  & ={sec}^{2}⁡\\theta -1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, we recall the different forms of the secant-tangent Identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & (1) & 1+{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta ={sec}^{2}⁡\\theta  \\\\  & (2) & {tan}^{2}⁡\\theta ={sec}^{2}⁡\\theta -1 \\\\  & (3) & {sec}^{2}⁡\\theta -{tan}^{2}⁡\\theta =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can rewrite our expression using $(2),$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{sec}^{2}⁡\\theta -1 & ={tan}^{2}⁡\\theta \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n{csc}^{2}⁡\\theta ({tan}^{2}⁡\\theta -{sin}^{2}⁡\\theta )={tan}^{2}⁡\\theta .\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-23796/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "eda44360-52ec-59f7-98b4-f8d866a465e9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-23796"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-120652/selection/bfb4427c3ceccaaec5efe2210a776568402caed7a449951877b893c55f99db51" :answer/id #uuid "cebeb8f2-7425-5baf-9240-281aa78ca5ce" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2-\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120652/selection/e811ffcd4c2c780fb2b014e182dd41593c4f608960ba2414b04bf0ee975c91c7" :answer/id #uuid "f85a09b5-30ce-58bb-8e56-4465b14bd515" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-2\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120652/selection/2b4efa0af4ed5ede6e81d6af5c9ffc00af95e418de0070eb87101bde5e78b145" :answer/id #uuid "3797355d-64b4-5573-99d6-706d341e9f93" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{cos}^{2}⁡x+1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120652/selection/c6320ec392e90656124bec836a388a81515802396f2025168d0ca9dac75dacd2" :answer/id #uuid "5438d4df-7d9e-5f8e-a4ad-8afb86bfc403" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120652/selection/7dc3344123c2433f42babec99e28fd57ed38955a71351ee6f61e2e33bdcaa637" :answer/id #uuid "74929d30-c5fc-5fd0-acaf-730629c4e6a3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1-2{cos}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-120652/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ceea422c-f036-5d50-925c-7f2352d16112" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-120652/selection/7dc3344123c2433f42babec99e28fd57ed38955a71351ee6f61e2e33bdcaa637" :answer-field/choices ["q-120652/selection/bfb4427c3ceccaaec5efe2210a776568402caed7a449951877b893c55f99db51" "q-120652/selection/e811ffcd4c2c780fb2b014e182dd41593c4f608960ba2414b04bf0ee975c91c7" "q-120652/selection/2b4efa0af4ed5ede6e81d6af5c9ffc00af95e418de0070eb87101bde5e78b145" "q-120652/selection/c6320ec392e90656124bec836a388a81515802396f2025168d0ca9dac75dacd2" "q-120652/selection/7dc3344123c2433f42babec99e28fd57ed38955a71351ee6f61e2e33bdcaa637"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-120652" :question/id #uuid "ccbc348b-5678-5234-b4b7-a8ceafb9b1d5" :question/math-academy-id "q-120652" :question/problem "$\\frac{{tan}^{2}⁡x}{{sec}^{2}⁡x}-1+{sin}^{2}⁡x=$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the different forms of the secant-tangent Identity:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & (1) & 1+{tan}^{2}⁡x={sec}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & (2) & {tan}^{2}⁡x={sec}^{2}⁡x-1 \\\\  & (3) & {sec}^{2}⁡x-{tan}^{2}⁡x=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can rewrite our expression using $(2),$ as follows:\n\n$$\n\\frac{{tan}^{2}⁡x}{{sec}^{2}⁡x}-1+{sin}^{2}⁡x=\\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡x-1}{{sec}^{2}⁡x}-1+{sin}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nNext, we recall the following identity: \n\n$$\n1-{sin}^{2}⁡x={cos}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nUsing the above identity, we can further simplify our expression as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡x-1}{{sec}^{2}⁡x}-1+{sin}^{2}⁡x & =\\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡x-1}{{sec}^{2}⁡x}-(1-{sin}^{2}⁡x) \\\\  & =\\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡x-1}{{sec}^{2}⁡x}-{cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{{sec}^{2}⁡x}{{sec}^{2}⁡x}-\\frac{1}{{sec}^{2}⁡x}-{cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =\\frac{\\cancel{{sec}^{2}⁡x}}{\\cancel{{sec}^{2}⁡x}}-\\frac{1}{{sec}^{2}⁡x}-{cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =1-\\frac{1}{{sec}^{2}⁡x}-{cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =1-{cos}^{2}⁡x-{cos}^{2}⁡x \\\\  & =1-2{cos}^{2}⁡x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n\\frac{{tan}^{2}⁡x}{{sec}^{2}⁡x}-1+{sin}^{2}⁡x=1-2{cos}^{2}⁡x.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-120652/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "eda44360-52ec-59f7-98b4-f8d866a465e9"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-120652"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-120655/selection/6cc445e05e1bfd47df2232290f3b26ce27802a52f3